{
  "_comment": [
    "Template for .mcp.json — the NRCan MCP servers the gems' scripts and an LLM session use.",
    ".devcontainer/setup.sh copies this to .mcp.json when that file is absent.",
    "",
    "NO KEY LIVES IN THIS FILE. Claude Code expands ${VAR} in url/headers/env/command/args,",
    "so the secret stays in your environment. .mcp.json itself remains gitignored (the family",
    "rule is 'NEVER stage .mcp.json') — this template is the tracked artifact instead.",
    "",
    "Set the key once, in the gitignored .env at the repo root:",
    "  cp .env.example .env && $EDITOR .env   (~/.bashrc auto-loads it)",
    "",
    "The two Ruby scripts that talk to these servers directly read HBIX_API_KEY too,",
    "and expand the placeholders below themselves, so the one key covers everything:",
    "  openstudio-necb/scripts/fetch_necb_8_4_text.rb",
    "  btap-modeling/scripts/building_stock.rb",
    "",
    "HBIX_MCP_BASE_URL is the only other knob and moves all six at once. There is no",
    "per-server override of either value — one key, one base URL, on purpose."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "codes": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "${HBIX_MCP_BASE_URL:-https://3ucoopudrb.execute-api.ca-central-1.amazonaws.com/prod}/codes/mcp",
      "headers": { "X-API-Key": "${HBIX_API_KEY}" }
    },
    "geocoding": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "${HBIX_MCP_BASE_URL:-https://3ucoopudrb.execute-api.ca-central-1.amazonaws.com/prod}/geocoding/mcp",
      "headers": { "X-API-Key": "${HBIX_API_KEY}" }
    },
    "weather": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "${HBIX_MCP_BASE_URL:-https://3ucoopudrb.execute-api.ca-central-1.amazonaws.com/prod}/weather/mcp",
      "headers": { "X-API-Key": "${HBIX_API_KEY}" }
    },
    "building-stock": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "${HBIX_MCP_BASE_URL:-https://3ucoopudrb.execute-api.ca-central-1.amazonaws.com/prod}/building-stock/mcp",
      "headers": { "X-API-Key": "${HBIX_API_KEY}" }
    },
    "modelling": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "${HBIX_MCP_BASE_URL:-https://3ucoopudrb.execute-api.ca-central-1.amazonaws.com/prod}/modelling/mcp",
      "headers": { "X-API-Key": "${HBIX_API_KEY}" }
    },
    "simulation": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "${HBIX_MCP_BASE_URL:-https://3ucoopudrb.execute-api.ca-central-1.amazonaws.com/prod}/simulation/mcp",
      "headers": { "X-API-Key": "${HBIX_API_KEY}" }
    }
  }
}
